{'symbol': 'HPE', 'date': '2022-09-26 09:00:00', 'title': "KAUST SELECTS HPE TO BUILD THE MIDDLE EAST'S MOST POWERFUL SUPERCOMPUTER", 'text': 'RIYADH, SAUDI ARABIA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HEWLETT PACKARD ENTERPRISE (NYSE: HPE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT KING ABDULLAH UNIVERSITY OF SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY (KAUST) SELECTED HPE TO BUILD ITS NEXT-GENERATION SUPERCOMPUTER, SHAHEEN III, TO DELIVER STATE-OF-THE-ART SUPERCOMPUTING AND ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE (AI) CAPABILITIES FOR ADVANCING RESEARCH IN FIELDS SUCH AS FOOD, WATER, ENERGY AND THE ENVIRONMENT. SUPERCOMPUTING CAPACITY HAS BECOME INCREASINGLY VITAL TO GLOBAL INNOVATION, INDUSTRY COMPETITIVENESS'}